Subject: [PATCH 8/8] live ISO: large console font for the Surface Laptop 7 panel

The console on the 2304x1536 panel renders at the default 8x16 size. Install
/etc/vconsole.conf with FONT=ter-132b into the snapdragon live root;
systemd-vconsole-setup applies it at boot. terminus-font is already listed in
configs/packages.aarch64 (ALARM extra, arch=any).

diff --git c/builder/build-iso.sh i/builder/build-iso.sh
index 16b8405..2365fc6 100755
--- c/builder/build-iso.sh
+++ i/builder/build-iso.sh
@@ -163,6 +163,9 @@ if [[ $ISO_ARCH == aarch64 ]]; then
       "$build_cache_dir/airootfs/etc/systemd/system/sl7-firmware-stage.service"
     ln -s ../sl7-firmware-stage.service \
       "$build_cache_dir/airootfs/etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/sl7-firmware-stage.service"
+    # 2304x1536 panel: the default console font is unreadably small.
+    install -Dm644 /configs/aarch64/vconsole.conf \
+      "$build_cache_dir/airootfs/etc/vconsole.conf"
   fi
   install -Dm644 /configs/aarch64/zz-aarch64-live.conf \
     "$build_cache_dir/airootfs/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/zz-aarch64-live.conf"
diff --git c/configs/aarch64/vconsole.conf i/configs/aarch64/vconsole.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..561cd8d
--- /dev/null
+++ i/configs/aarch64/vconsole.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+# terminus-font is in packages.aarch64; ter-132b is 16x32, legible on the 2304x1536 panel.
+FONT=ter-132b
